---
title: 7UP Cake
author: Cheryl Spinner
---

== Cake ==

Preheat #oven{} to 325°F.

Whisk together @yellow cake mix{1%pkg} and @pudding mix{1%pkg}(lemon or vanilla) in a #large bowl{}.

Add @eggs{4}, @vegetable oil{3/4%cup}, @sour cream{3/4%cup}, and @lemon extract{1%tsp}.

Beat on medium speed for ~{2%minutes}, until smooth and fluffy.

Gently fold in @7UP{3/4%cup} until just combined.

Pour the batter into a #Bundt pan{} or a #sheet pan{}.

Bake for ~{40%minutes} in a Bundt pan or ~{28%minutes} in a sheet pan, until the top is golden and a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean.

For a Bundt cake, cool in the pan for ~{15%minutes}, then invert onto a #cooling rack{} and let cool completely.

Pour the icing over a cooled Bundt cake or a hot sheet cake.

== Icing ==

Whisk together @powdered sugar{2%cups}, @lemon juice{3%tbsp}, and @milk{2%tbsp} until smooth.